+---
+id: dl-003-input-is-validated-in-the-domain-and-rejected-with-an-invalid-input-error
+type: decision-log
+title: "Input is validated in the domain and rejected with an invalid-input error"
+status: pending
+---
+
+<!-- decision-log body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+## Context
+Screens pass raw user input to the list, so odd tasks got in.
+
+## Decision
+Validation lives in the domain (`src/domain/task.ts`), runs before any state change and returns a
+`Result` with the new error code `invalid-input` (r4). The 120-character limit counts the trimmed
+title. A tag is invalid if empty or containing any whitespace. Tags are not trimmed.
+
+## Consequences
+Rejected input leaves the list, ids and `updatedAt` untouched. `TodoErrorCode` gains a member, which
+callers switching on codes may need to handle.
